# Bonecrusher Giant: "Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell, this creature deals 2 damage to that spell's
# controller." Bot1 casts Trash the Town at its own Giant with two modes, the counters and the trample: the Giant is chosen
# for two instances of "target" (CR 115.3) but becomes the target of the spell once (CR 601.2c), so it triggers once and
# Bot1 takes 2, not 4. Both modes still happen to it.

